# Proteus host posture kit — HexOS-style ops dashboard backends.
# samba: shared folders (usershares — no-root CRUD from the Workloads app)
# smartmontools: drive health for the Storage/Health dashboard cards
samba
smartmontools
# NVMe health for the Storage/Health dashboard cards (smartctl covers SATA;
# nvme-cli fills the gaps on NVMe-only boxes)
nvme-cli
# Container engine for Workloads (VM/ctr ops + one-click Apps catalog).
# Prefer podman over docker — rootless-friendly; Workloads probes podman first.
podman
